* GF180MCU Two-Stage CMOS Op-Amp Simulation (Unity-Gain Buffer Transient & AC)
.lib "gf180mcu.lib" tt

* Power Supplies
Vdd vdd 0 DC 3.3
Vss vss 0 DC 0.0

* Bias Generator (Current Mirror Reference)
M8 vbias vbias vss vss nfet_03v3 W=10.0u L=0.5u
Rbias vdd vbias 40k

* Differential Pair in Unity-Gain Feedback Configuration
M5 n_tail vbias vss vss nfet_03v3 W=20.0u L=0.5u
M1 n1 vout   n_tail vss nfet_03v3 W=10.0u L=0.5u
M2 n2 vin_step n_tail vss nfet_03v3 W=10.0u L=0.5u
M3 n1 n1 vdd vdd pfet_03v3 W=20.0u L=0.5u
M4 n2 n1 vdd vdd pfet_03v3 W=20.0u L=0.5u

* Second Gain Stage (Common-Source)
M6 vout n2 vdd vdd pfet_03v3 W=40.0u L=0.5u
M7 vout vbias vss vss nfet_03v3 W=40.0u L=0.5u

* Frequency Compensation & Load
Rz n2 n_cc 1k
Cc n_cc vout 1.2p
Cload vout 0 10p

* Input Pulse (1.2V to 1.8V buffer test step)
Vin_step vin_step 0 PULSE(1.2 1.8 100u 1u 1u 400u 1m)

.tran 1u 1m 0

* Control Statements
.control
run
print allv > plot_data_v.txt
print alli > plot_data_i.txt
.endc
.end
